    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/76f340ae614dbc629706d8d4e1c1b970.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/76f340ae614dbc629706d8d4e1c1b970.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/76f340ae614dbc629706d8d4e1c1b970.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Treasure Royale</strong> is a fast paced t<strong>reasure hunt party game</strong> that transports the players to a dynamic island arena filled with action and treasure. <br><br>Use different <strong>skills and tactics</strong> to fight for <strong>precious gems</strong> while trying to find one of the <strong>treasure chests</strong> hidden in the island. <br><br>Play <strong>online</strong> with random players or fight against your <strong>friends</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/5e23fa5c2a27151c2fc00acc3f7c1ecf.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/5e23fa5c2a27151c2fc00acc3f7c1ecf.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/5e23fa5c2a27151c2fc00acc3f7c1ecf.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Swing your shovel to drop the gems of you enemies.<br>Steal all of the gems to eliminate others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/4c95dba84a25292ee51c7afefdbe77d0.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/4c95dba84a25292ee51c7afefdbe77d0.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/4c95dba84a25292ee51c7afefdbe77d0.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use your shovel as a ranged weapon to dig and throw sand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/3eaaab2388b01f7a42ebd79fc2edc5e8.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/3eaaab2388b01f7a42ebd79fc2edc5e8.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/3eaaab2388b01f7a42ebd79fc2edc5e8.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hidden treasures appear when half of the players are eliminated. Possible location of the treasure chest can be seen on the minimap.<br>Be the one to uncover the treasure chest and hold it for more than 10 seconds to be the winner but be careful, you will drop the treasure chest if anyone hits you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/282dbb320640421ca1aded0aa12495b7.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/282dbb320640421ca1aded0aa12495b7.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/282dbb320640421ca1aded0aa12495b7.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Gameplay Features</h2><strong>Cursed Statues: </strong>Use the statues around the island and use your gems to create natural distasters in the island.<br><br><strong>Maps: </strong>Choose between Tropical Island or Swamp Island with different island hazards and themes.<br><br><strong>Game Modes (Upcoming): </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic: Steal gems, uncover the hidden treasure.<br></li><li>Sumo: Stay inside the ring.<br></li><li>Holy Treasure: Hunt for the precious treasure chest.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/76f340ae614dbc629706d8d4e1c1b970.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/76f340ae614dbc629706d8d4e1c1b970.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/76f340ae614dbc629706d8d4e1c1b970.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Treasure Royale</strong> is a fast paced t<strong>reasure hunt party game</strong> that transports the players to a dynamic island arena filled with action and treasure. <br><br>Use different <strong>skills and tactics</strong> to fight for <strong>precious gems</strong> while trying to find one of the <strong>treasure chests</strong> hidden in the island. <br><br>Play <strong>online</strong> with random players or fight against your <strong>friends</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/5e23fa5c2a27151c2fc00acc3f7c1ecf.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/5e23fa5c2a27151c2fc00acc3f7c1ecf.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/5e23fa5c2a27151c2fc00acc3f7c1ecf.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Swing your shovel to drop the gems of you enemies.<br>Steal all of the gems to eliminate others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/4c95dba84a25292ee51c7afefdbe77d0.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/4c95dba84a25292ee51c7afefdbe77d0.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/4c95dba84a25292ee51c7afefdbe77d0.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use your shovel as a ranged weapon to dig and throw sand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/3eaaab2388b01f7a42ebd79fc2edc5e8.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/3eaaab2388b01f7a42ebd79fc2edc5e8.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/3eaaab2388b01f7a42ebd79fc2edc5e8.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hidden treasures appear when half of the players are eliminated. Possible location of the treasure chest can be seen on the minimap.<br>Be the one to uncover the treasure chest and hold it for more than 10 seconds to be the winner but be careful, you will drop the treasure chest if anyone hits you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/282dbb320640421ca1aded0aa12495b7.poster.avif?t=1732723976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/282dbb320640421ca1aded0aa12495b7.webm?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526470/extras/282dbb320640421ca1aded0aa12495b7.mp4?t=1732723976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Gameplay Features</h2><strong>Cursed Statues: </strong>Use the statues around the island and use your gems to create natural distasters in the island.<br><br><strong>Maps: </strong>Choose between Tropical Island or Swamp Island with different island hazards and themes.<br><br><strong>Game Modes (Upcoming): </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic: Steal gems, uncover the hidden treasure.<br></li><li>Sumo: Stay inside the ring.<br></li><li>Holy Treasure: Hunt for the precious treasure chest.</li></ul>",
